    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "With the tragic loss of Shark, Astral finally took possession of all 100 Number Cards."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yuma, we have finally accomplished our goal of gathering all 100 Number Cards. Their combined energies allow me access to the Numeron Code, the source of all creation throughout the universe."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "It gives me the power to rewrite both the future and the past."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Which I shall use to fulfill my final mission."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "But I thought we finished our final mission."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Wait, you don’t mean..."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "My mission... to annihilate Barian World."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "I thought you were done with that nonsense!"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "No. Barian World is the enemy of Astral World. It must be extinguished."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Haven’t you learned anything at all, Astral?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "You don’t have to fight anymore! Your two worlds can be at peace!"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Peace may have been your goal. It is not mine. Mine remains the destruction of Barian World."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Dream on because that ain’t happening!"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "And how do you plan to stop me, Yuma? Do you dare challenge me to a duel?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "You bet!"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "You must realize the foolishness of your endeavor. Since I possess all the Number Cards, you cannot win."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Do you still wish to duel?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "More than ever!"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Very well. But when I win, I will do more than destroy Barian World."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I will use the Numeron Code to erase your memories. It will be as if we never met."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Agreed?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Agreed."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Fine. We shall duel tonight at the courtyard where we first met."
    }
  ]
